WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.833 --> 00:00:02.134
-Amazing stuff happening.

00:00:02.134 --> 00:00:03.769
But tonight, and I'm so happy
you chose our show,

00:00:03.769 --> 00:00:05.705
