Oh, my God!

00:00:08.208 --> 00:00:09.642
You're giving me
a heart attack already.

00:00:09.642 --> 00:00:11.511
Gee, Quest over there,
he's like, "Let's go.

00:00:11.511 --> 00:00:13.146
Let's keep it rolling."

00:00:13.146 --> 00:00:14.514
Well, yeah,
I do have a big announcement.

00:00:14.514 --> 00:00:15.982
I mean, I've done a lot
of exciting things this year.

00:00:15.982 --> 00:00:17.450
You know, I've started
my own production company,

00:00:17.450 --> 00:00:18.751
called
Unicorn Island Productions.

00:00:18.751 --> 00:00:20.085
-Yeah.
Unicorn Island.

00:00:20.085 --> 00:00:22.321
-And so, I'm really into just
creating dope things.

00:00:22.321 --> 00:00:23.923
And so, I did I want to announce
something on this show,

00:00:23.923 --> 00:00:25.591
but before I do, I want to say

00:00:25.591 --> 00:00:27.827
I could not be more thrilled
to do it on this show,

00:00:27.827 --> 00:00:30.062
and I really do mean this,
Jimmy, because I know you all

00:00:30.062 --> 00:00:31.498
watch him,
and he's so funny,

00:00:31.498 --> 00:00:35.201
but Jimmy is one of the nicest
human beings on this planet.

00:00:35.201 --> 00:00:37.970
Truly, I mean that.
I really, really mean that.

00:00:37.970 --> 00:00:39.472
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:39.472 --> 00:00:43.376
From the very first time
I came on this show --

00:00:43.376 --> 00:00:45.311
From the very first time I came
till right now,

00:00:45.311 --> 00:00:46.980
you've been such a supporter
and such a champion.

00:00:46.980 --> 00:00:48.581
So I want to
say thank you to you

00:00:48.581 --> 00:00:50.149
for letting me announce it
on this show,

00:00:50.149 --> 00:00:51.518
and I'm forever grateful.

00:00:51.518 --> 00:00:54.654
But I do have an announcement,
and that is

00:00:54.654 --> 00:00:59.825
