own NBC late-night show!

00:00:59.825 --> 00:01:02.295
[ Cheers and applause ]
-Yes!

00:01:02.295 --> 00:01:10.303
♪♪

00:01:10.303 --> 00:01:12.138
Welcome!
-Thank you!

00:01:12.138 --> 00:01:13.606
-Congratulations!

00:01:13.606 --> 00:01:16.809
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:01:16.809 --> 00:01:18.978
All right, wait.
Let's stop.

00:01:18.978 --> 00:01:20.646
