with Lilly Singh."

00:01:36.763 --> 00:01:38.364
-Oh, come on.
-I know, I know.

00:01:38.364 --> 00:01:39.398
-When does it premiere?
Do we know?

00:01:39.398 --> 00:01:41.267
-So, fallish,
probably September.

00:01:41.267 --> 00:01:42.902
-Wow.
-And I'm so excited because

00:01:42.902 --> 00:01:45.371
I truly get to create a show
from scratch.

00:01:45.371 --> 00:01:46.939
You know,
I get to make it inclusive,

00:01:46.939 --> 00:01:49.341
I get to create comedy segments
and interview people

00:01:49.341 --> 00:01:51.176
