than three staff members.

00:01:59.852 --> 00:02:00.920
[ Laughter ]

00:02:00.920 --> 00:02:03.056
And my sound guy
won't also be an extra

00:02:03.056 --> 00:02:04.190
and won't also
write the scripts.

00:02:04.190 --> 00:02:06.592
So, it's like -- it's nice.

00:02:06.592 --> 00:02:09.162
-So it's gonna be me,
then Seth Meyers, and then you.

00:02:09.162 --> 00:02:10.263
-Yeah!

00:02:10.263 --> 00:02:11.296
-You're in the
NBC late-night family.

00:02:11.296 --> 00:02:13.232
-I mean...
-That's good stuff.

00:02:13.232 --> 00:02:15.868
-Can I just say...?
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:02:15.868 --> 00:02:17.736
-That's a good block.
That's a good block right there.

00:02:17.736 --> 00:02:20.773
-Can I just say --
I mean, I got to just say

00:02:20.773 --> 00:02:23.909
a huge shout-out to all the
women who have been before me

00:02:23.909 --> 00:02:25.411
