00:02:25.411 --> 00:02:27.580
because I couldn't have done it
without them paving the path.

00:02:27.580 --> 00:02:30.483
Truly, I couldn't have.
-I totally agree.

00:02:30.483 --> 00:02:32.719
-But I do think
it's a little awesome

00:02:32.719 --> 00:02:36.989
