-I don't know.

00:02:41.727 --> 00:02:43.196
I'm trying to decide
if I want a desk.

00:02:43.196 --> 00:02:45.564
I really don't know.
-Do you want to try it out?

00:02:45.564 --> 00:02:48.934
-Okay. Okay.
Okay. Okay.

00:02:48.934 --> 00:02:51.403
All right.
Thank you so much.

00:02:51.403 --> 00:02:52.906
All right.
-I love your energy.

00:02:52.906 --> 00:02:54.474
I love your energy.
-Oh, thank you.

00:02:54.474 --> 00:02:56.041
Thank you.
Thank you, my friend.

00:02:56.041 --> 00:02:57.643
Congrats on your success.
-Hello, my friend.

00:02:57.643 --> 00:02:58.811
"Congrats on your success."
[ Laughs ]

00:02:58.811 --> 00:03:00.112
-Oh, my God.
This is pretty --

00:03:00.112 --> 00:03:01.214
Should I ask you
some questions, then?

00:03:01.214 --> 00:03:03.383
-Yeah, go ahead.
-All right, cool.

00:03:03.383 --> 00:03:05.785
So, Jimmy --
Jimmy Fallon, everyone.

00:03:05.785 --> 00:03:09.121
Jimmy Fallon, everyone.
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:03:09.121 --> 00:03:10.924
I love this guy.
I love this guy.

00:03:10.924 --> 00:03:13.926
Also has one of the biggest
YouTube channels in the world.

00:03:13.926 --> 00:03:15.962
