-My advice -- don't get sick.

00:03:23.903 --> 00:03:26.338
-Cool.
-You can't get sick.

00:03:26.338 --> 00:03:29.275
There's so many people
that depend on you, crew-wise.

00:03:29.275 --> 00:03:30.910
